    "text": "Child screams in distress at Lawrence House apartment, Chicago IL\nFamily Offense\nNear W Lawrence Ave, Chicago, IL 60640A young boy has been screaming in distress for 20 minutes at an apartment building called Lawrence House on West Lawrence Avenue. Someone nearby is heard asking him to stop because he is scaring them.\nAudio|Source: Chicago Police Department Zone 11\n00:20\nTranscript:\n00:00\n22. Can you check the well-being at near W Lawrence? Near W Lawrence at the Lawrence house coming from room 807. Front desk states that there's been complaints about a young boy screaming in distress for the last 20 minutes.\n00:15\nSays that they can hear the child say, T.P. Stop doing that. You're scaring me.\n00:20\nI have no further.\nDisclaimer:\nThis transcript was automatically generated and may contain inaccuracies. Please verify the information independently.",
